Start=
★ The Next Battle Cat Design Contest ★<br>
September 17th ~ October 9th

YOUR design could appear in The Battle Cats!!!<br>
Submit your original Battle Cat proposal and our art team might choose it to join the Cat Army!

<<How to Enter>><br>
① Create an original Battle Cat character design (including both normal and evolved forms!)<br>
You can tell us it's name and a short character description, or just leave it up to us!<br>
② Post your entry to one of the options below<br>
A) your Facebook timeline with hashtag #NextBattleCat (make sure the post is set to Public!)<br>
B) your Twitter feed with hashtag #NextBattleCat and @PONOS EN tagged!<br>
C) your Instagram account with hashtag #NextBattleCat and @battlecatsofficial tagged!

On October 9th, our team of artists will look through all the entries and choose their favorites! You could win...

● GRAND PRIZE - One winner<br>
Your Cat design will appear in the Battle Cats app!<br>
PLUS, you get a 1500 Cat Food bonus reward!

● RUNNER-UP PRIZE - Five winners<br>
A 1000 Cat Food bonus reward for each winner in this category!<br>
Plus, your design will be reposted on the Battle Cats official social media pages!<br>
※ Runner-up entries may be selected to appear in the game in the future as well! (No guarantees though...)<br>
※ Please be aware that PONOS reserves the right to edit or change elements of the winning entry to avoid copyright issues, or to otherwise ensure the highest standards of artistic and gameplay quality.

▼Click below for full details!<br>
https://ponos.s3.amazonaws.com/information/appli/battlecats/news/en/charadesign_2017.html

