End=<p></p>
The #NextBattleCat design contest has officially ended!

Thanks so much for sending in your AWESOME #BattleCats designs!

The PONOS design team will now be choosing the best ideas from all of their favorite submissions, and we'll be revealing the winners on November 10, 2017.

We had over one thousand entries, so we'll need some time to look through all the artwork! In the meantime, login to Battle Cats before October 14 to pick up a Rare Ticket as thanks to everyone for your hard work!

Stay tuned to see our artists choices!

